  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 1199915,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/matthew25187/DataStandardizer",
  "published": "2026-10-08T22:29:16.493Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Carry the ISO 3166 country codes on the UN M49 area metadata.\n- The UnM49AreaCodeAttribute declared Iso3166Part1Alpha2Code and Iso3166Part1Alpha3Code but nothing ever populated them.\n- Emit both from all three generators.\n- Expand an area code with the codes of the country row it came from.\n- Read the codes through the extensions, which offer GetIso3166Part1- Alpha2Code and GetIso3166Part1Alpha3Code over all three enums against the established guard on an undefined member, so that reaching the metadata no longer demands reflection at the call site.\n- Assert that every member of a ByAlpha enum agrees with its own name and that an area reached through either ByAlpha enum or through UnM49Area reports the same pair.\n- Correct the summary comments on both properties, which described a country code as a language code, ISO 3166 being the standard for countries and territories.",
